    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ-ᾰμύσσω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tear, scratch</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ δὲ
				Χρόα καλὸν ἀ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				6.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὸν ἄμυξε κάτα ῥέθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.218
				</span></i>
			 (Antip. Sid.): c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεγάλας
				ἀμυχὰς κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.Com.
				3.6
			</span></i> (anap.):—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμύξατο Χεῖρα
			ἀραιήν</span> she <i>scratched her</i> hand, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.425
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτωπον καὶ ῥῖνα καταμύσσονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κὰδ δέ σ᾽ ἀμυξάμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.491
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mnasalc.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταμυχθεὶς τὴν κνήμην ὑπὸ κυνοσβάτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Did.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.70d
			</span></i>.</div>
